<title>UK: Moody's has no comment on Turkey sovereign ratings.</title>
<headline>Moody's has no comment on Turkey sovereign ratings.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moody's Investors Service has no comment on any possible move in Turkey's sovereign ratings, an official from the rating agency said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The comment followed talk in financial markets that an announcement on Turkey's ratings could be made as early as Friday.</p>
<p>The Moody's official repeated that Turkey had been on watch for a possible downgrade since January 9. But, citing Moody's policy regarding market rumours, he declined to comment on whether any ratings action was imminent. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 4041</p>
</text>
